Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 16:20:45 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1203/1286] HERESY 1169: one shape for the icon buttons
 (framed, 2px corners, a hover that recolours the frame and grows the icon a
 tenth); New song a double icon, twice as wide
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The rc3 list «One shape for the icon buttons across the rooms». An inventory of the rooms found four shapes: framed tools
(5px), frameless icons (3px, 25–31 px), the rating chips (7px), circles (the cheat-sheet's ♪, Play). Viktor chose: «Б. Все в
рамке, как сейчас инструменты в шапке… При наведении меняется цвет рамки. 2px закругление. При наведении можно зумить иконку на
малость, скажем процентов десять»; «плеерные кнопки не трогаем… Крошечные замочки не трогай». So the tools, the frames'
buttons, the folds, the dice, the cheat-sheet's opener and the rating chips wear a 1px frame with 2px corners; on hover the
frame takes the hover colour and the icon grows 10 % (no motion with reduced motion asked). The player's buttons and the
knobs' locks are as they were.

«Кнопку текстовую + New song замени на иконку, и сделай кнопку в два раза шире… Можно смеженную/двойную»: our own solid glyph
beside the Font Awesome ones, a plus and a pair of beamed notes, drawn twice as wide; the button 72 px, its words its label and
tip as for the others.

Kitchen suite: 399 passed, 0 failed, 7 skipped.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 tools/console/app.css         | 13 +++++++++++++
 tools/console/heresy-icons.js |  5 ++++-
 tools/console/index.html      |  2 +-
 3 files changed, 18 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/tools/console/app.css b/tools/console/app.css
index 3a01385..bd7882b 100644
--- a/tools/console/app.css
+++ b/tools/console/app.css
@@ -4272,3 +4272,16 @@ body[data-frame="compose"] #view-compose, body[data-frame="take"] #view-take {
   overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: normal; }
 /* HERESY 1168: the text profile is for readings: dimmed, its controls off, while the Creator's profile is music */
 #tpRow.is-off { opacity: .5; }
+
+/* HERESY 1169 (Viktor 07.10.2026, the rc3 list «One shape for the icon buttons»: «Б. Все в рамке, как сейчас инструменты в
+   шапке… При наведении меняется цвет рамки. 2px закругление. При наведении можно зумить иконку на малость, скажем процентов
+   десять»; «плеерные кнопки не трогаем… Крошечные замочки не трогай»): every icon button but the player's in a frame with
+   2px corners; on hover the frame takes the hover colour and the icon grows a tenth */
+.btn.icon-only, .frame-tools .icon-btn, .lib-fold, .dice, .hi-open, .lib-toggle, .coll-chip-ico { border: 1px solid var(--line-a); border-radius: 2px; }
+:is(.btn.icon-only, .frame-tools .icon-btn, .lib-fold, .dice, .hi-open, .lib-toggle, .coll-chip-ico):hover { border-color: var(--hover-line, var(--line-strong)); }
+:is(.btn.icon-only, .frame-tools .icon-btn, .lib-fold, .dice, .hi-open, .lib-toggle, .coll-chip-ico) :is(.hz-icon, .ui-ico, svg) { transition: transform .12s ease; }
+:is(.btn.icon-only, .frame-tools .icon-btn, .lib-fold, .dice, .hi-open, .lib-toggle, .coll-chip-ico):hover :is(.hz-icon, .ui-ico, svg) { transform: scale(1.1); }
+@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { :is(.btn.icon-only, .frame-tools .icon-btn, .lib-fold, .dice, .hi-open, .lib-toggle, .coll-chip-ico) :is(.hz-icon, .ui-ico, svg) { transition: none; } }
+/* New song: its double icon twice as wide, and the button with it */
+#newSong .hz-icon { width: 34px; }
+#newSong.btn.icon-only { min-width: 72px; }
